Package: rtists
Title: R for Tissue Integrity Superimposed on Tractography Streamlines
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        given = "Aymeric",
        family = "Stamm",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "aymeric.stamm@cnrs.fr",
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8725-3654")
    ))
Description: Provides interactive 3-D visualisation of tractography streamlines
    and bundles defined in the 'fiber' package. Aesthetics such as line colour
    can be mapped to per-point, per-streamline, or per-bundle metadata, or
    derived from the local fibre orientation.
